.git
**/.env*
**/bin
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
coverage.out
**/.venv
**/.ruff_cache

# No image copies the site. On a machine that built it, these directories hold hundreds of
# megabytes, and each image is built with the repository root as its context, so a build would
# send them to Docker for nothing.
**/node_modules
**/.vite
**/.astro
services/frontend/dist
services/frontend/public/logos

# Files of editors and coding assistants. No image needs them.
.claude
.agents
.vscode
